  "description": "Before the first pedal stroke, there's the first push, the first glide and that unforgettable moment when little feet leave the ground. The Nukeproof Cub Scoot 12\" is where the adventure begins. Built for the youngest generation of riders, this proper little balance bike helps develop the confidence, coordination and balance they'll need for a lifetime of fun on two wheels. With the same mountain bike DNA as its bigger Nukeproof brothers, the Cub Scoot features a lightweight 6061-T6 aluminium frame, low standover height and adjustable saddle to help little riders find their feet. Kid-specific handlebars and grips make it easy for small hands to take control, while chunky off-road tyres mean the adventures don't have to stop when the pavement ends. Weighing just over 4kg, it's easy for little riders to handle and a whole lot easier for parents to carry when those little legs have had enough. And with a frame that's ready for a rear disc brake to be fitted, the Cub Scoot can help young riders develop their skills as their confidence grows. From those first tentative steps to confidently gliding along the trails, every little adventure is a big achievement. No pedals. No limits. Just adventure.",
